Yes!!  This seems like the most reasonable, workable idea regarding the
so-called "too easy" side of Nethack I've seen yet on this group.  It would
be easy to set up; just like a stack of options.  This comes from one of the
beginners, who has only had one game good enough to get him to the Wizard,
though not far past him, in 3 years of playing 2 different versions.  Even
using most of the "tricks" discussed frequently on this group, I find the
game difficult, challenging, and fun, for the most part.  I would agree, from
the game I got to the Wizard in, that Ghennom is hell, if you'll excuse the
pun, but it's a hell of drudgery, not difficulty. Only the meddlesome Wizard
makes them difficult, and for a "newbie" like myself, virtually impossible
without the best possible chances and equipment.  For all of you who seem to
be racing down, lopping of Yendor's head, and rushing up again with the
amulet, think what it would be like for a first timer.  I mean, just myself,
